{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "f61af844-2a77-85c0-b90a-329288095898",
  "created_at": "2026-01-09T11:42:31-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Sheila Brennan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Rosa Delgado",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T11:38:52-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Rosa. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T11:38:57-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, hi, yes. Um, I need to renew a dog license. Hold on, let me put this down. Okay. The dog license, for my dog."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T11:39:06-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can help with that. Has the license expired, or is it coming up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T11:39:12-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, I got a notice, I think. Or it was something from the vet. [pause] Anyway, it's due, and I lost the tag. The tag with the number on it. It fell off the collar, I think, or the dog ate it, who knows."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T11:39:27-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that's fine, we can replace a lost tag when you renew. Can I get your name and address so I can look you up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T11:39:36-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sheila Brennan. One thirty-two Mill Street. Up on the Hill, by, um, hold on, I'm looking for my keys. By the little park."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T11:39:44-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, Mill Street. And what's the dog's name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T11:39:48-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Biscuit. Well, it's Biscuit on the, no wait. Is it on the license under my name or the dog's name? I never know which one you want."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T11:39:58-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Both, usually. The license is under your name, with the dog's name listed. I'll find it either way."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T11:40:05-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, good. So do I have to, can I do it over the phone, or do I come in? I thought maybe I had to come in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T11:40:15-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "For a lost tag, it's easiest to come in person. You can come to City Hall and we'll do the renewal and give you a new tag right there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T11:40:25-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And what do I bring? The old tag, I don't have it, that's the whole problem."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T11:40:32-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You don't need the old tag. Bring the current rabies certificate for the dog, that's the main thing. And a photo ID with your address on it. If the dog's been spayed or neutered, bring that paperwork too, if you have it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T11:40:47-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The rabies. Is that the paper from the vet? The one with the, um, the sticker on it? Or is that a different one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T11:40:56-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's probably it. It should say the dog's name and the date of the vaccine and when it expires. If you have the vet's receipt instead, that might not be enough, so look for the certificate."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T11:41:09-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh. The receipt. I think I have the receipt. Hang on. [pause] Sorry, I'm in the car, I mean I'm about to get in the car. I have to run something over to the school. My grandson, no, my, the kid forgot a lunchbox. So I'm taking it over there now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T11:41:27-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, no problem, you go ahead and take care of that. Nothing's urgent on the license today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T11:41:33-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So I come in, and I bring the rabies paper, not the receipt, and the ID. And no tag. Right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T11:41:41-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. Rabies certificate, photo ID, and we'll issue a new tag. We're open regular hours, but with the coastal storm hitting today, I'd wait until it's calmed down. No rush to come in this afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T11:41:53-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, is that today? I thought that was tomorrow. Well, that's why the school's, no, they're still open. I don't know. Okay, so next week then."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T11:42:02-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Next week is fine. If the certificate is hard to find, your vet's office can usually send a copy."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T11:42:09-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, the vet. I'll call them. Wait, so the license is under my name, and the dog's name goes on it, and I bring the certificate. Not the receipt."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T11:42:19-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. You've got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T11:42:22-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you, dear. I think. I'll write it down in the car. Bye now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T11:42:28-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Drive safe, Ms. Brennan. Bye."
    }
  ],
